msgstr "最小 / モダン"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:436
msgid ""
"Compact receipt with a centered store header, bold double-border order band and dense item rows. Same essentials as Standard, less vertical space."
